{"unit_id":"ding112__MoneyPal#card-zh","repo":"ding112/MoneyPal","commit":"50c731df274775b17cd8ae544840796df0fade72","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"MoneyPal 是面向 DSH Web 的个人财务账本插件，基于 Beancount 在当前工作区保存复式账本。它向助手注册账本流水、余额、账户、损益表和资产负债表查询工具，也提供账本校验、初始化及交易写入能力。导入或记录交易时，助手先生成可检查的预览，再等待用户确认后提交。Web 界面还可查看当前会话账本的资产与负债余额。适合希望用自然语言管理本地账本的个人用户；需要兼容的本地财务运行环境。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/dsh.ts:66-70","src/finance/contract.ts:123-129","src/host.ts:24-56"]}
{"unit_id":"ding112__MoneyPal#card-en","repo":"ding112/MoneyPal","commit":"50c731df274775b17cd8ae544840796df0fade72","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"MoneyPal is a DSH Web plugin for managing a Beancount ledger. It queries transactions, balances and financial statements, lists accounts, validates and initializes ledgers, and adds transactions. Entries are previewed and written after user confirmation; Web view shows assets and liabilities.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/dsh.ts:66-70","src/finance/contract.ts:123-129","src/host.ts:24-56"]}
